#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:4
msgid "OvPhysX Backend"
msgstr "OvPhysX 后端"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:8
msgid ""
"OvPhysX is **highly experimental** and is not recommended for general use "
"yet. The public surface is changing rapidly while the backend is under "
"active development. Expect feature coverage and test commands to change "
"between Isaac Lab 3.0 beta releases."
msgstr ""
"OvPhysX 仍处于 **高度实验性** 阶段，目前不建议普遍使用。后端正在积极开发，公共接口变化较快。在 Isaac Lab 3.0 "
"各测试版本之间，功能支持和测试命令可能变化。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:15
msgid ""
"Do not combine OvPhysX with the Kit visualizer. Commands such as "
"``physics=ovphysx --visualizer kit`` are unsupported because ovphysx loads "
"USD-dependent PhysX plugins from its own package, while Kit already owns a "
"separate USD/plugin stack in the same process. Use ``--visualizer "
"newton_gl``, ``--visualizer rerun``, ``--visualizer viser``, or omit "
"``--visualizer`` for headless execution."
msgstr ""
"不要将 OvPhysX 与 Kit 可视化器组合使用。``physics=ovphysx --visualizer kit`` "
"等命令不受支持：ovphysx 从自身软件包加载依赖 USD 的 PhysX 插件，而 Kit 在同一进程内管理另一套独立的 USD 和插件。请使用 "
"``--visualizer newton_gl``、``--visualizer rerun`` 或 ``--visualizer "
"viser``；也可以不传 ``--visualizer``，以无界面方式运行。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:22
msgid ""
"OvPhysX is a kit-less variant of the PhysX backend. It drives PhysX directly"
" (without the Omniverse Kit runtime) and reads scene-level solver parameters"
" from the USD ``PhysicsScene`` prim rather than from a Python config. The "
"Python config :class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg` only exposes the "
"handful of GPU buffer sizes that are not represented on the USD schema."
msgstr ""
"OvPhysX 是不依赖 Kit 的 PhysX 后端变体。它直接驱动 PhysX，无需 Omniverse Kit 运行时，并从 USD 的 "
"``PhysicsScene`` prim 读取场景级求解器参数，而不是从 Python 配置读取。Python 配置 "
":class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg` 只暴露少数 USD 模式中没有对应表示的 GPU 缓冲区大小。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:28
msgid "OvPhysX is selected through :class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg`:"
msgstr "通过 :class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg` 选择 OvPhysX："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:38
msgid "Why use OvPhysX?"
msgstr "为什么使用 OvPhysX？"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Kit-less execution.** OvPhysX avoids Omniverse Kit, which makes it a "
"useful experimental path for headless deployments and for backends that "
"don't need the Kit runtime stack."
msgstr ""
"**不依赖 Kit 的运行。** OvPhysX 无需 Omniverse Kit，适合探索无界面部署，以及不需要 Kit 运行环境的后端。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:43
msgid ""
"**USD-as-source-of-truth.** Solver parameters are taken from the "
"``PhysicsScene`` USD prim, so authoring tools that already manage USD scenes"
" do not need a parallel Python config."
msgstr ""
"**以 USD 为权威依据。** 求解器参数来自 ``PhysicsScene`` USD prim，已有 USD 场景管理能力的创作工具无需再维护一份"
" Python 配置。"

