#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:71
msgid ""
"Additional OvPhysX work remains in flight. IMU, Frame Transformer, Joint "
"Wrench, PVA, Ray Caster, and rendering support are not documented as "
"supported here until their implementations land on ``develop`` and pass the "
"backend smoke tests."
