"并通过后端基本运行测试之前，本页不将其列为受支持功能。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:77
msgid "Heterogeneous cloning"
msgstr "异构克隆"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:79
msgid ""
"OvPhysX 0.6.3 is required for heterogeneous runtime cloning. Tensor bindings"
" use numeric environment order so indexed resets, actions and observations "
"address the correct variant. Variants may differ in geometry but must "
"preserve body, joint and tendon layout. Isaac Lab checks prototype rotation "
"axes and tendon layouts; OVPhysX checks body and joint metadata when binding"
" articulations."
msgstr ""
"异构运行时克隆要求 OvPhysX "
"0.6.3。张量绑定按环境的数字顺序排列，保证索引式重置、动作和观测对应正确变体。变体的几何可以不同，但刚体、关节和肌腱布局必须一致。Isaac Lab"
" 检查原型旋转轴和肌腱布局；OVPhysX 在绑定关节体时检查刚体与关节元数据。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:85
msgid ""
"The clone context compiles the plan's prototypes and world assignments once."
" The physics manager attaches one exported stage, replays the native copies,"
" and warms the runtime before assets and sensors bind. Hard reset reuses the"
" same declarations; there is no separate consumable queue. Binding paths "
"come from the plan's world layout and environment template, not from native "
"clone order."
msgstr ""
"克隆上下文只编译一次计划中的原型和仿真世界分配。物理管理器挂接一个导出的 USD "
"舞台，重放原生副本，并在资源和传感器绑定之前预热运行时。硬重置复用相同声明，不另设一次性消费队列。绑定路径来自计划的世界布局和环境模板，而不是原生克隆顺序。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:91
msgid ""
"Authored sources all receive native environment ID zero. Every world "
"containing a source or USD-only physics therefore imports all its declared "
"assets as originals. Other worlds clone their assets from a complete "
"original world of the same composition, using one native environment ID per "
"destination world. This keeps a robot, table and object able to contact one "
"another without destination placeholders. Only declared asset subtrees are "
"copied; unrelated authored assets are retained."
msgstr ""
"所有写入 USD 的源对象均获得原生环境 ID 零。因此，包含源对象或仅通过 USD "
"定义物理的每个仿真世界，都会将其声明的全部资源作为原始对象导入。其他世界从组成相同、完整的原始世界克隆资源，每个目标世界使用一个原生环境 "
"ID。这样，机器人、桌子和物体可以相互接触，无需目标占位对象。只复制声明的资源子树，其他写入 USD 的资源保持不变。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:98
msgid ""
"Keep :attr:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg.filter_collisions` enabled "
"to isolate original worlds with USD collision groups. GPU copies "
"additionally use native environment-ID filtering. CPU has no native "
"environment-ID filtering in OvPhysX 0.6.3, so it imports all declared USD "
"copies and uses collision groups. Large overlapping original layouts can "
"still exhaust broadphase pair capacity; use spatially separated "
"environments."
msgstr ""
"保持 :attr:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg.filter_collisions` 启用，以通过 USD "
"碰撞组隔离原始世界。GPU 副本还使用原生环境 ID 过滤。OvPhysX 0.6.3 的 CPU 模式没有原生环境 ID 过滤，会导入全部声明的 "
"USD 副本，并使用碰撞组。大量重叠的原始布局仍可能耗尽粗检测碰撞对容量，因此应将环境在空间上分开。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:106
msgid "Deformable limitations"
msgstr "可变形体限制"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:108
msgid ""
"OvPhysX deformables currently require every body matched by one "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject` to have the same number of "
"simulation nodes. Initialization raises an error for mixed node counts "
"instead of exposing padded state that would produce incorrect reductions."
msgstr ""
"目前 OvPhysX 要求同一个 :class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject` "
"匹配到的所有物体具有相同数量的仿真节点。节点数量不同时，初始化会报错，而不会暴露填充后的状态，以免产生错误的归约结果。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:113
msgid ""
"Deformable scenes also require full-stage materialization. Startup cost "
"therefore grows with the number of authored environments. Use this path for "
"small validation scenes; training-scale workloads with thousands of "
"environments are not currently supported. Deformable bodies are not "
"supported by the heterogeneous fast-path cloner."
msgstr ""
"可变形体场景还要求将整个 USD "
"舞台实例化展开，因此启动开销会随已定义环境数量增加。这条路径适合小规模验证场景，目前不支持数千个环境的训练规模工作负载。异构快速克隆器不支持可变形体。"

