#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:128
msgid ""
"The ``--inexact`` flag preserves packages installed through other extras. "
"Use ``--extra ov`` to install both public OvPhysX and OVRTX runtimes. The "
"combined extra pairs OVRTX 0.5.1.385782 with OVStage 0.2.1; OVRTX 0.4.1 is "
"not compatible with this runtime combination. The legacy Isaac Lab installer"
" also supports ``./isaaclab.sh -i 'ov[ovphysx]'`` and ``./isaaclab.sh -i "
"'ov[all]'``."
msgstr ""
"``--inexact`` 会保留通过其他扩展依赖安装的软件包。使用 ``--extra ov`` 可同时安装公开发行的 OvPhysX 和 OVRTX"
" 运行时。这组扩展依赖将 OVRTX 0.5.1.385782 与 OVStage 0.2.1 配套使用；OVRTX 0.4.1 与该组合不兼容。旧版 "
"Isaac Lab 安装器也支持 ``./isaaclab.sh -i 'ov[ovphysx]'`` 和 ``./isaaclab.sh -i "
"'ov[all]'``。"

